# tools/ is shipped: users build the sim agent, the catalog tool, models and
# the pinned QBox on their machine from these sources and scripts
# (tools/README.md). Only what those builds write is left out, the same files
# .gitignore names.
tools/qbox-catalog/qbox-catalog
tools/sim-agent/*.so
tools/sim-agent/*.json
tools/*/build/**
# The patches are shipped (build-qbox.sh applies them); the source two of them
# are made from, and the tool that makes them, are for maintainers.
patches/make-patches.js
patches/*/src/**
